  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "flashinfer-trace",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tFlashInfer Trace\n\t\n\nWe provide an official dataset called FlashInfer Trace with kernels and workloads in real-world AI system deployment environments. FlashInfer-Bench can use this dataset to measure and compare the performance of kernels. It follows the FlashInfer Trace Schema.\nIt is organized as follows:\nflashinfer_trace/   # Here\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 definitions/\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 workloads/\n\nflashinfer-trace/   # On Hugging Face\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 solutions/\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 traces/\n\nExample solutions and traces directories, featuring\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer-trace.",
